    "factsheet": [
        {
            "heading": "Victorian Drinks Factory -",
            "paragraphs": [
                "Artsect artist studios in Victorian drinks factory built in late 1700’s and possible birthplace of commercial carbonated drinks.\nAnd in this beautiful space, beautiful people come together to work and create, building connection and making ideas into reality: Mai, working as a textile artist experimenting with bio leather , sustainable materials and sculptural knits. \nA jeweller, Amina Ben Ismail is a Tunisian painter who works by layering oil pastels onto acrylic/oil paint."
            ]
        }
